{"id":"90dd25ebb867c1e5","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-pcf-good-scale-point.md","title":"ZFC PCF Good Scale Point","display":"df-zfc-pcf-good-scale-point — ZFC PCF Good Scale Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf-good-scale-point","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf-good-scale-point"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf-good-scale-point — ZFC PCF Good Scale Point","depends_on":["[[58-df-club]]","[[58-df-cofinality]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-limitordinal]]","[[58-df-zfc-large-pcf-scale]]","[[58-df-cardinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf-good-scale-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf-good-scale-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf-good-scale-point — ZFC PCF Good Scale Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"58-df-club\">58-df-club</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ed6a5f84f08e526\" href=\"?note=4ed6a5f84f08e526\" title=\"58-df-zfc-large-pcf-scale\">58-df-zfc-large-pcf-scale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta,\\vec f,A,J\\in V\">\\(\\delta,\\vec f,A,J\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|{-}|\">\\(|{-}|\\)</span> is the cardinality operator (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargePcfScale}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargePcfScale}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}:V\\to V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcfGoodScalePoint}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcfGoodScalePoint}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}good\\text{-}scale\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcfGoodScalePoint}_S(\\delta,\\vec f,A,J) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcLargePcfScale}_S(\\vec f,A,\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f),J)\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\delta\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\land|A|&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\delta)\\land\\exists C,Z\\in V\\;\\Bigl(C\\subseteq\\delta\\land\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Z,C,J)\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in C\\;(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to\\forall i\\in A\\setminus(Z(\\alpha)\\cup Z(\\beta))\\;(\\vec f(\\alpha)(i)&lt;\\vec f(\\beta)(i)))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}good\\text{-}scale\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcfGoodScalePoint}_S(\\delta,\\vec f,A,J) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcLargePcfScale}_S(\\vec f,A,\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f),J)\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\delta\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)\\land|A|&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\delta)\\land\\exists C,Z\\in V\\;\\Bigl(C\\subseteq\\delta\\land\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Z,C,J)\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in C\\;(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to\\forall i\\in A\\setminus(Z(\\alpha)\\cup Z(\\beta))\\;(\\vec f(\\alpha)(i)&lt;\\vec f(\\beta)(i)))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Goodness requires coordinatewise increase on a club modulo coherently chosen <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>-small exceptions, not merely the scale's automatic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{J}\">\\(&lt;_{J}\\)</span>-increase.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-club","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-club]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[